fee here is just wonderful, and the menu was one of those \"I'd like to order everything, thank you\" types. I finally settled on Eggs Louisiane, a version of eggs benedict with fresh spinach and crab cake that was one of the best things I've ever tasted. We had an appetizer of fried green tomatoes which included fresh crabmeat and was to die f..."},{"business_id":"75FY8ZQx5nOWP0VFmNvWfw","review_id":"wTPK4XnLBz7cGQxVpNQUjA","date":"2018-07-12T19:18:21","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9496710300445557,"text_excerpt":"We really enjoyed our meal here! Reservations were easily made for brunch, and it was just a quick Uber ride from the French Quarter. The restaurant is a quaint old bungalow, with various rooms to dine in. They offer a bloody mary bar during brunch, and they let you try a sample shot of the two juice options. Their standard red mix was outstanding. However, I still decided to go with the duck fat sazerac, because it sounded so intriguing. It was outstanding, although it just tasted like a normal really good sazerac to my uneducated palate. :-) We started with an appetizer of fresh lump crabmeat over fried green tomatoes, and I could have stopped right there. They were so generous on the c..."},{"business_id":"75FY8ZQx5nOWP0VFmNvWfw","review_id":"A6V1zSDNiESfh0_UcQeUMQ","date":"2013-07-25T21:22:10","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9482067823410034,"text_excerpt":"After tacky pub crawling my way through Uptown redneck style the night before, I was ready to hit up some brunch Sunday morning! Atchafalaya is my favorite brunch place in the city! It's a perfect mix of great food, reasonable prices, quaint atmosphere, live music and great service. I called to see if we could get a reservation for 3. They were booked solid, but told me to come on in and the wait probably wouldn't be very long. When we arrived, we are told the wait would be 45 minutes. Not bad at all when you've got a \"Build your Own Bloody Mary\" bar to occupy your time! We decided to start with mimosas. The mimosas were good, and very generous with the champagne, but I found them to be o..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"75FY8ZQx5nOWP0VFmNvWfw","photo_id":"kiJkk7A9Hc2xq4OG2kF8Pw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/kiJkk7A9Hc2xq4OG2kF8Pw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8312050104141235},{"business_id":"75FY8ZQx5nOWP0VFmNvWfw","photo_id":"9nxhOhfB0w6Jo_Evz9F6kQ","label":"menu","image_url":"/photos/9nxhOhfB0w6Jo_Evz9F6kQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8261381387710571},{"business_id":"75FY8ZQx5nOWP0VFmNvWfw","photo_id":"AILia2ieyQtDRB_gHDP9AA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/AILia2ieyQtDRB_gHDP9AA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8065648078918457},{"business_id":"75FY8ZQx5nOWP0VFmNvWfw","photo_id":"-Anit-NG2m9BBvY5uYLHOQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/-Anit-NG2m9BBvY5uYLHOQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8010247945785522},{"business_id":"75FY8ZQx5nOWP0VFmNvWfw","photo_id":"YuP4mjjeOpfVZ1rTMA_YGA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/YuP4mjjeOpfVZ1rTMA_YGA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7732429504394531}]},"notebook_case":null}
